{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":18,"code":"JOB","name":"Job","testament":"OT"},"chapter":36,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"JOB 36:1"},"Elihu also proceeded, and said, ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"JOB 36:2"},"Suffer me a little, and I will shew thee that ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["I have"]}," yet to speak on God’s behalf. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"JOB 36:3"},"I will fetch my knowledge from afar, and will ascribe righteousness to my Maker. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"JOB 36:4"},"For truly my words ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall"]}," not ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["be"]}," false: he that is perfect in knowledge ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," with thee. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"JOB 36:5"},"Behold, God ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," mighty, and despiseth not ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["any: he is "]},"mighty in strength ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," wisdom. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"JOB 36:6"},"He preserveth not the life of the wicked: but giveth right to the poor. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"JOB 36:7"},"He withdraweth not his eyes from the righteous: but with kings ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are they"]}," on the throne; yea, he doth establish them for ever, and they are exalted. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"JOB 36:8"},"And if ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["they be"]}," bound in fetters, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," be holden in cords of affliction; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"JOB 36:9"},"Then he sheweth them their work, and their transgressions that they have exceeded. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"JOB 36:10"},"He openeth also their ear to discipline, and commandeth that they return from iniquity. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"JOB 36:11"},"If they obey and serve ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["him,"]}," they shall spend their days in prosperity, and their years in pleasures. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"JOB 36:12"},"But if they obey not, they shall perish by the sword, and they shall die without knowledge. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"JOB 36:13"},"But the hypocrites in heart heap up wrath: they cry not when he bindeth them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"JOB 36:14"},"They die in youth, and their life ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," among the unclean. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"JOB 36:15"},"He delivereth the poor in his affliction, and openeth their ears in oppression. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"JOB 36:16"},"Even so would he have removed thee out of the strait ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["into "]},"a broad place, where ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," no straitness; and that which ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["should be"]}," set on thy table should be full of fatness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"JOB 36:17"},"But thou hast fulfilled the judgment of the wicked: judgment and justice take hold ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["on thee. "]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"JOB 36:18"},"Because ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," wrath, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["beware"]}," lest he take thee away with ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," stroke: then a great ransom cannot deliver thee. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"JOB 36:19"},"Will he esteem thy riches? ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["no,"]}," not gold, nor all the forces of strength. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"JOB 36:20"},"Desire not the night, when people are cut off in their place. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"JOB 36:21"},"Take heed, regard not iniquity: for this hast thou chosen rather than affliction. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"JOB 36:22"},"Behold, God exalteth by his power: who teacheth like him? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"JOB 36:23"},"Who hath enjoined him his way? or who can say, Thou hast wrought iniquity? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"JOB 36:24"},"Remember that thou magnify his work, which men behold. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"JOB 36:25"},"Every man may see it; man may behold ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it"]}," afar off. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:25"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"JOB 36:26"},"Behold, God ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," great, and we know ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["him"]}," not, neither can the number of his years be searched out. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:26"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"JOB 36:27"},"For he maketh small the drops of water: they pour down rain according to the vapour thereof: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:27"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"JOB 36:28"},"Which the clouds do drop ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," distil upon man abundantly. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:28"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"29","sid":"JOB 36:29"},"Also can ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["any"]}," understand the spreadings of the clouds, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["or"]}," the noise of his tabernacle? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:29"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"30","sid":"JOB 36:30"},"Behold, he spreadeth his light upon it, and covereth the bottom of the sea. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:30"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"31","sid":"JOB 36:31"},"For by them judgeth he the people; he giveth meat in abundance. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:31"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"32","sid":"JOB 36:32"},"With clouds he covereth the light; and commandeth it ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["not to shine "]},"by ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["the cloud"]}," that cometh betwixt. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:32"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"33","sid":"JOB 36:33"},"The noise thereof sheweth concerning it, the cattle also concerning the vapour. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 36:33"}]}]}
